OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMonday will be a generally dry
OL,6,Fday across the region with bright or
OL,7,Fsunny spells. Some more prolonged
OL,8,Fsunshine is possible later. Becoming
OL,9,Fwarm in lighter winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRemaining dry overnight with
OL,12,Fclear spells for many, however
OL,13,Fvariable amounts of cloud will feed in
OL,14,Facross western counties of the region.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FA bright start, particularly
OL,17,Fin the east of the region. Cloudier
OL,18,Felsewhere but conditions will improve
OL,19,Fas cloud lifts during the day. Feeling
OL,20,Fvery warm, locally hot in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
